# Downloaded CDN images (large binary assets)
frontend/cdn/shop/files/
frontend/patchkraze.com/cdn/shop/files/*
# ...except the ordering-process cards, which the homepage uses and ships locally
!frontend/patchkraze.com/cdn/shop/files/order-process-*.png
# ...and the patch category card images (new assets, shipped locally — they
# don't exist on Shopify's CDN, so the /cdn/shop/files/* proxy would 404 them)
!frontend/patchkraze.com/cdn/shop/files/embroidered-patches-1.jpg
